    "measurementTechnique": [
      "Data were produced using WRF (https://www.mmm.ucar.edu/weather-research-and-forecasting-model) version 3.8.1. The model is initialized was two weeks prior to the start of each water year and run non-consecutively for water-years 1987-2020. Raw model output variables are post-processed and subset to the region East/Taylor river watershed. The model files contain one month of data each, with hourly timesteps. Files are \"netcdf\" format. Data processing was performed using \"xarray\" (https://xarray.pydata.org/en/stable/). No bias corrections or modifications have been made to the output fields -- these are 'raw' model outputs. Additional details of the model configuration and validation will be provided in an upcoming publication."
    ],
